    "title": "Anna Lee Collins Mandrell - NewsBreak",
    "text": "15 days ago Anna Lee Collins Mandrell, 104, lifelong Cordell resident passed away September 22, 2025 at the Cordell Christian Home. Anna was born May 29, 1921 in Cordell, Oklahoma to William and Lucy (Riggs) Cantrell. Anna attended Lake Valley School. She was united in marriage to John Collins on May 29, 1939... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
